    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Restaurant - A simple and beautiful jigsaw puzzle game with a restaurant theme. It depicts the daily life of five pretty and cute girls in a restaurant, accompanied by relaxing music. After completing the level, you can enjoy the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has three difficulty levels: 2x2, 2x4, 4x4 puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press &quot;F&quot; to turn on black and white when doing puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'Blank' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can quickly view girl pictures by pressing the AD key, left and right keys or the left and right keys of the mouse in the gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>",
